description	"The Stranger aka 'Qimir'

An unpredictable fighter that doesn't follow the rules of lightsaber combat.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% faster RoF
-- Lightweight
- Lightsaber (Dual/Red)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (3)
-- EX Saber Training (2)
-- Chain Limit: 4
-- BP Regen: 2/.4s
-- 61/31% less Dual/Red damage
-- 35% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
--- 50% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (2)
- Rage (3) ^3[CS4]
- Mind Trick (1) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Slow Faller
- Cortosis (2)
- Dexterity (3)
- Healing (1)
- Miraluka Vision (1)
- Sense Immunity
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Force Block (4)
- Force Focus (3)
- Fury (2)
- BP-Free Jumps

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]"